      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FAITH IN CAEDEN (1) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Tap Out Boston (18.69) in a Grade 5. Led around the bend before fighting on well and should give a sight. Must come into calculations. SPEAK TO ME (8) stalked the lead from the inside draw then burst clear to score (18.45) at this track in Maiden over 320m. One of main contenders. IVY STAR (2) was prominent throughout when winning two back but could manage only midfield last time when 6th and beaten 9 lengths at this track (19.02). Worth following up. HORRIFIC (3) is a last-start placegetter at this track and distance – sure to have admirers.",
